            <ArticleTitle>Studies on analgesic activity of Cleome viscosa in mice.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>262-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The analgesic activity of methanol extract of Cleome viscosa, given orally at the doses of 100, 200, 400 mg/kg was evaluated for its analgesic activity in mice using the acetic acid-induced writhing and the tail flick, tail clip, tail immersion methods. The extract showed promising activity in all the tests.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
